<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15259" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρμεν-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Armenia,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ μεγάλη</span> and 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ μικρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					11.12.3
				</span></i>
			 and <i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i> sq., cf. <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Mith.</u>
				105
			</span></i>:—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρμένιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
				<i>Armenian:</i> also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρμενιακός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				11.14.12
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κόν, τό,</span>
			<i>apricot, Prunus Armeniaca,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.115
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.593
			</span></i> (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρμενική</span></b> 
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηλέα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				12.76
			</span></i>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κὸς λίθος</span>”
				<i>limestone coloured blue by copper carbonate,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.105
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσόκολλα Ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.89
				</span></i>
			.</div>
